//sha-256;WSkHkQtW5EQfy29PZtCupyNP0Y_68qjGcTDsdfv4TgIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka2ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;0bS5aTCJgfsDc-bH3A1IlF4QyD-aOhYEWC0cD8QW0xEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarke32000ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ZYn7uwWNBLCd49cQ3MQKpGriZ97_QW1A9sDdkRs-enYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkd5377ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Y80Xh35apGw_DBm8QtE8MGgMxerYkWMqJErSReuo15oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka0ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;erX1BZZx2KhV4IDPW4q_PtNp5Qjc-Z2iBQOX3SSg_8Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarka1ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Ylk82eXiuWxkC8I2ifI9PYNEjOqiKM7Nbnb1gqUcQfEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NuLOxz10nS9dn6imvbKfSi3fcJv4XwRmi5QDRTeGa2Yƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky1As the World Cup final approaches this Sunday just outside New York City, atmospheric conditions have cast uncertainty over the match, which is slated to be held in an open-air stadium [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/). Large swaths of the United States, including the Midwest and the East Coast, have been blanketed by smoke from Canadian wildfires, forcing cities to confront hazardous air quality [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/). While the air quality index in the region climbed to unhealthy levels on Thursday, triggering state alerts, the governing body for the tournament has not yet detailed a contingency plan for the event [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/).

## A Gap in Institutional Preparedness

FIFA currently appears to have no standardized policy to implement adjustments or specific protocols for wildfire smoke, distinguishing it from other leagues that have already established such triggers [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/). By contrast, the National Women's Soccer League maintains a detailed policy that mandates game modifications or postponements when the air quality index reaches specific thresholds, such as 101 or 200 [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/). Neither FIFA nor New York City Department of Health officials immediately responded to Grist's request for comment [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/).

## Risks to Human Performance and Health

"These are high-level athletes who are moving a lot of air through their lungs," Dr. Courtney Howard, an emergency room physician and Global Climate and Health Alliance official, told the Associated Press. "They shouldn't be practicing outside if the air quality levels are at hazardous sort of ranges for wildfire-related air pollution" [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/). Vulnerable groups, including children, older individuals, and those with pre-existing conditions like asthma, also face increased dangers from the current air quality conditions [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/).

## Watching the Atmosphere

Forecasters continue to track smoke patterns, with officials noting that conditions near the stadium remained in the unhealthy range as of Friday morning [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/). While New York City has experienced hazy, orange skies throughout the week, the specific quality of the air on Sunday will depend on shifting wind patterns [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/). "Hopefully, this is a wakeup call to FIFA and all other sport leagues and competitions of the need for regulations and a comprehensive plan to deal with climate risks," said Nicholas Watanabe, a professor of sport and entertainment management at the University of South Carolina [Wildfire smoke threatens the World Cup final, FIFA still doesn't have a plan](https://grist.org/extreme-weather/wildfire-smoke-threatens-the-world-cup-final-fifa-still-doesnt-have-a-plan/).ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1HFXpAPQASs0WvDnxBYL7JsiLb-BIy3yOyvRYmBNQ1sƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx$cbe1444f-c636-4e69-a9f1-a98d896c025fƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Fiy4R5egHRwhC_6Cl9AlK5NQx4MUP3rmjBSpKDlPknwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhend_turnƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;_F9v2ozU_Z4_X8gMn-AmW5N1CyA0kF-D0youhqCZmP8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgsuccessƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WOWhMOAs6RJFVcQ9X4WmI9YTdC8oe-O4z-JqiO8Fj5oƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmark